<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>CODE by Dalin</title>
<meta name="description" content="The best coding guide for beginners and experts" />
<meta name="google-site-verification" content="googled7f9b130046a34e5" />
<link rel="icon" type="image/webp" href="favicon.webp" />
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="favicon.png" />
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
body{font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;background:#0a0a0f;color:#fff;min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;padding:20px}
.hero{max-width:700px}
.logo{width:120px;height:120px;margin:0 auto 24px;border-radius:28px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(124,58,237,.4)}
.logo img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}
h1{font-size:64px;font-weight:900;margin-bottom:12px}
p{color:#9ca3af;font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:32px}
a.btn{display:inline-block;padding:14px 28px;background:#fff;color:#000;border-radius:12px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="hero">
<div class="logo"><img src="favicon.webp" alt="C"></div>
<h1>CODE by Dalin</h1>
<p>The best coding guide for beginners and experts. Learn, build, and ship faster.</p>
<a class="btn" href="https://github.com/darexkjr-maker">Start Learning</a>
</div>
</body>
</html>